{"parse": {"title": "PD-11", "pageid": 144779, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/PD-10\" title=\"PD-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">PD-11</span><a href=\"/wiki/PD-12\" title=\"PD-12\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">PD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">11</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A4.8D.E5.8F.A4.E6.8A.80.E6.9C.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"复古技术\">复古技术</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 复古技术</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Retro-Futurism</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>众<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>拾<span class=\"color-value\"></span>柴<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>或<span class=\"color-value\"></span>者<span class=\"color-value\"></span>拾<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>玻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>璃<span class=\"color-value\"></span>琴<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 38510112</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_06\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-s02_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-s02_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-s02_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-528320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-528320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-528320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科学家Ⅶ：</div><div>呃……呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>装配间沉默着，自那以后又有即将发作的人自愿加入，如今低沉的呜咽声此起彼伏，直到稀释在众人的无言中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔在纸上排列着可能有效的解毒剂，写了几样后又划掉，她的椅下已经散落着五六个纸团。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>阿托品、苯那辛……都试过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>氯解磷定……再试试双复磷？太危险了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科学家Ⅷ：</div><div>有效了！有效了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从椅子上站起，看向大喊声的方向，这次她难得没有斥责对方在临时病床前喧哗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科学家Ⅷ：</div><div>第六类是有效的……！六号患者苏醒了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-650712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-650712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-650712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>老天！终于啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>别光顾着感叹，把现有的第六类都取出来，先给重症患者注射！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我们还不清楚是症状缓解还是回光返照，继续观察！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在有序的指挥下，一部分重症患者率先恢复了意识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>呃……我能感受到，这解毒剂一定没有问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>刚注射聚合物时的那种新鲜感正在回来，神经毒素的影响消失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你今天才注射的聚合物……我只能相信你对聚合物的变动感知比其他长期使用者更敏感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>好吧，谢谢你，小梅斯梅尔，你救了我一命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>希望你可以吸取教训，不要随便注射药物了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这在拉普拉斯只能算件小事，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>拉普拉斯并不正常，这里也不是拉普拉斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-305715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>停电？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-305716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-305716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-305716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>还有人在用呼吸机吗？快换上备用电源！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"521101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-521101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-521101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"521101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-521101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-521101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-521101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-521101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科学家Ⅵ：</div><div>不用担心，没有停电！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">广播：</div><div>自毁程序已启动，倒计时：15分钟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>自毁程序？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">广播：</div><div>小梅斯梅尔小朋友，X小朋友，你们的家人在找你们，请到能源室来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-650814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-650814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-650814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>维尔汀似乎遇到麻烦了，小梅斯梅尔小朋友，我们得赶快去找家长了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>病床上的疯狂科学家自己拆除了绷带，然后坐起，正面承受同僚的白眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>看来暂时不用担心你的身体状况了，相信你可以立即进行奔跑等剧烈运动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>没问题！但我只是个科学家，可没有运动员那样的体魄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>那病人的看护……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-650701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-650701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/HeadIconSmall-650701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>快去吧。我在这儿当安保，伊桑也醒了，不会有事的！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_07\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-s02_bg_07.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-s02_bg_07.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-s02_bg_07.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>捷列什科娃已经发出了信号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>同时检测到大量失控机器人正在离开原本的巡回区域。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>以及关于疏散方案的整理——目前安全撤离人群的可能性极低，您仍要执行吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们必须用尽一切办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>收到，这就去搜寻仍然可用的交通工具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>维尔汀博士，您的朋友就要到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>三、二、一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>左伶迅速地打开门，两名拉普拉斯的研究员带着一身金属燃烧的味道冲了进来后，又在失控机器人涌入前关上了门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>维尔汀，自毁程序是怎么回事？马克西姆他……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小梅斯梅尔看见了躺在地上、太阳穴开了个大洞的马克西姆，作案工具正躺在死者的手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我没能来得及阻止他，自毁程序也在他死时启动了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>推测是马克西姆将自己的心跳与能源室的自毁程序绑定了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>除非启动停止程序，否则无法阻止自毁进程，但停止程序的密码遭到了篡改，推测只有——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>只有马克西姆知道密码……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人工梦游治疗师看了看同伴，又看了看死去的马克西姆，她明白了叫自己来的意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>如果还没有彻底脑死亡，或许可以靠人工梦游提取一些信息，但是有很多问题……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>首要问题自然是太阳穴上的大洞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>希望那颗子弹没有破坏关键的脑组织。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>他应该安装了“思想”控制器，或许除了大脑之外，我们还可以询问他体内的聚合物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>让人工梦游接触一项未知的技术？我无法预测会发生什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>而且我们时间不多，想在爆炸前找出密码，需要有人潜入梦境诱导和检索马克西姆的记忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>潜入死者的梦境本来就很危险，更不用说现在我们设备不齐全，潜入者很可能会迷失在梦境中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们必须一试，这是现在最可靠的手段了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>每次与你们共事我都别无选择……X，按我的要求制造一些临时设备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……只要功能达标，你想造多大的戈德堡机械都行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>如你所愿～女士们，能请你们搭把手吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>正在查询，人工梦游……无相关条目，开始直接遵从X博士的指令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>然后我需要一台玻璃琴，哪里有玻璃琴？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>这里是聚合物展览馆，并非艺术博物馆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>那我们就无从谈起……X，有可能用戈德堡机械实现玻璃琴的效果吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>当然可以，只需要一个足球场的空间和四个小时就可以做出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们没有这么多时间，左伶，聚合物展览馆中能否找到些替代物？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>正在查询可能制造或替代玻璃琴功能的展品……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房间角落，维修小站的显示屏闪了两下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺拉：</div><div>看来是时候展现一下我的专业本领了～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺拉：</div><div>我可以做出玻璃琴！但你们得先用原材料满足我～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>诺拉？你一直在吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺拉：</div><div>自毁的消息都传开了，小孩！我在维修小站之中来回穿梭，可兜兜转转，都只能困在这飞行平台里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺拉：</div><div>我可不想和一群小毛孩死在一起，如果可以的话我希望死的时候身边能有个大帅哥，快拿材料来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>各位，开始拆窗户吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_07\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-s02_bg_07.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-s02_bg_07.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-s02_bg_07.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵紧张的敲打声后，一个占满房间的机器被拼凑出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>我已经录下了制作的全过程留作分析，X博士，这是非常有意思的技术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>虽然是我给出的要求，但你确信它可靠吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>当然！它只是看上去繁琐，但原理很简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我会相信你这一次。那么，谁要潜入到马克西姆的梦境中？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">诺拉：</div><div>我不干，那家伙丑死了，我不要去他的梦里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我！我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不是你，你得留在这儿维护装置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即便其中一方没有眼睛，实际成为唯二候补人选的一人与一机仍然对视了一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>让我去吧，我对人工梦游很有经验。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>几位可能会需要有关聚合物的建议，我提议由我去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>那两位为什么不一起去呢？头盔的数据线可以拆解下来，连接在左伶脑后的脊椎上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>这很不明智，如果失败了，你们两个都会在梦境中遇难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但两个人一起也可以提高成功的可能，X是对的，小梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……回去之后，我要请长假。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>戴上头盔吧，你们可能会有酥麻的感觉，但不用担心或惊慌，那只是一些暂时的副作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>酥麻感？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>对，这是进入马克西姆“梦境”的必要流程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>明白，相关信息已录入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>剩下的就交给你们了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>放心吧，我还顺带搭建了一些防御工事，机器人暂时不会来骚扰我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>那……我要开始了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "PD-11"}}